## Patch notes for 2026.164.237

These patch notes summarize the changes from version 2026.162.255.

Added 18 new endpoints:
* Country.ListCountries
* Country.GetStates
* Holidays.ListHolidays
* Holidays.CreateHolidays
* Holidays.RetrieveHoliday
* Holidays.UpdateHolidayName
* Holidays.DeleteHoliday
* Npt.GetNptTime
* ProjectField.UpdateProjectFieldDefinition
* ProjectField.UpdateProjectFieldOptions
* ProjectMembers.AddTeamToProject
* Task.UpdateApprovalStatus
* Task.RetrieveTaskTimeAllocations
* TaskLink.CreateTaskLink
* TaskLink.UpdateTaskLink
* TaskLink.DeleteTaskLink
* TaskLink.RetrieveTaskLinks
* Workload.QueryResourceWorkload

Renamed 12 endpoints:
* Renamed Changeset.RetrieveChangesetStatus to Changeset.RetrieveChangeset
* Renamed Changeset.RetrieveCompletedChangesetStatus to Changeset.RetrieveCompletedChangeset
* Renamed File.DownloadAThumbnailImage to File.DownloadThumbnailImage
* Renamed NptDiscussion.LikeAComment to NptDiscussion.LikeNptComment
* Renamed NptDiscussion.RemovesAThumbsupFromAComment to NptDiscussion.UnlikeNptComment
* Renamed NptDiscussion.RemoveAComment to NptDiscussion.RemoveComment
* Renamed NptFiles.UploadFileToNonProjectTasks to NptFiles.UploadNptFile
* Renamed ProjectMembers.RetrieveProjectsTheUserIsAMemberOf to ProjectMembers.RetrieveProjectsByUser
* Renamed ProjectMembers.CreateOrUpdateUserProjectMembership to ProjectMembers.CreateOrUpdateProjectMembership
* Renamed Task.FetchTheFirstLevelChildTasksFromTheTask to Task.RetrieveFirstLevelChildTasks
* Renamed Task.MarkTaskAsReadForTheCurrentUser to Task.MarkTaskRead
* Renamed Teams.RetrieveZipFileForTeamsIntegrations to Teams.RetrieveIntegrationBundle

Changes to data models:
* IntegrationProviderDto: Added new field `includeCosts`
* IntegrationProviderDto: Added new field `timeSyncDirection`
* TimesheetAdminTypeDto: Added new field `providerShortId`


